<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil loadings fall, Europe takes 80 pct.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil loadings fall, Europe takes 80 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent Blend crude oil loadings from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal fell to 435,034 tonnes in the week to April 1 from 728,627 tonnes the previous week, Shetland Islands Marine Operations said.</p>
<p>Nearly 80 percent of liftings went to British and other north European refineries.</p>
